# Leave this unset for normal local development. Requests to /api, /sprints,
# and /projects are proxied by Vite's dev server (see vite.config.js) to the
# API Gateway at http://localhost:8080 - the frontend never talks to
# individual microservices directly, and this proxy means the gateway
# doesn't need a CORS policy for the browser to reach it.
#
# Only set this if you want to bypass the proxy and call a gateway directly
# (it would then need CORS enabled for whatever origin the frontend runs on).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
